    "title"             "Knox Relay"
    "description"       "Server-side bridge mod for remote server management. Exports game state, inventory snapshots, player positions, progression, live character vitals and appearance, and processes item delivery and money deposit queues via file-based JSON communication. Provides /account register for linking a character to a website account, /report for filing a player report from inside the game, and a friends list with optional map pins: right-click a survivor to ask, accept from the Knox Desk or the website."
    "changenote"        "[h1]1.38 — Desk survives a server restart[/h1]\n[b]Fixed[/b]\n[list]\n[*]The Knox Desk no longer builds the vanilla inventory window at all. After a dedicated-server restart and reconnect, the rail UI stays; the old brown title bar, collapse chevron, and resize grips do not come back.\n[*]The Desk title is KNOX DESK  1.38 from the client Lua itself, so a leftover copy is obvious even before server Lua has loaded.\n[*]A long-uptime restart no longer lets PZ reinstall the last published Workshop copy over the seeded Lua. The Workshop cache item is marked current after seeding so CheckItemState returns Ready.\n[/list]"
}
